# Portfolio Project: Enterprise Risk Register & Vendor Assessment

## 📋 Project Overview
This project simulates a comprehensive Governance, Risk, and Compliance (GRC) risk register and third-party risk assessment framework tailored for a fintech/payment-processing environment. It demonstrates the ability to identify, quantify, and treat security risks across cloud infrastructure, access control, third-party vendors, and data privacy regulations (**SOC 2, PCI-DSS, ISO 27001, NIST SP 800-53**).

